      "headings": [
        {
          "text": "Madison AI Handles More of the Work More Accurately",
          "level": 2,
          "sourceClasses": [
            "h3",
            "bigger"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "paragraphs": [
        "Madison AI just graduated with an \"MBA\"! What that means in practice is that the tool is smarter at handling interactions and inference. You no longer have to pick the right agent or remember which workflow to use.",
        "Type what you need into the prompt box, and the assistant figures out the rest. It reads your intent, selects the right workflow, and builds the output. Faster starts. Fewer steps. The same quality as you expect. Give it a try with a citizen newsletter, a voting history, or a code lookup."
      ],
