      "headings": [
        {
          "text": "Less Friction in the Day-to-Day Flow",
          "level": 2,
          "sourceClasses": [
            "h3",
            "bigger"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "paragraphs": [
        "Uploaded files now convert more accurately, so the AI reads and uses them with higher reliability. Tables, images, and complex document formats all work better. You can also drag and drop screenshots directly into the chat.",
        "For planning staff working with site plans, permit documents, or mixed-format files, this removes a real daily friction point and produces more accurate outputs."
      ],
      "listItems": [],
      "quotes": [
        {
          "text": "\"It is like a quantum leap forward in how we can interact with data that we upload.\"",
          "attribution": "Heyden Enochson, Head of GTM, Madison AI",
          "portrait": {
            "url": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/691d9787eade11d4963fe1d2/69d20bf82699aad3185c30ac_heyden.avif",
